{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We combined a city-building simulator and crafting\u00a0alchemy game to get an interesting turn-based strategy. In this game, you do not just build buildings, but change those that are there into the ones you need, spending and receiving resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/meme.png?t=1743924193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/ttl_thing.png?t=1743924193\" />Each building can be obtained from several recipes and used in a number of recipes to obtain another building and/or resources, including units and other valuables. Thus, the same building can cost different amounts of different resources and require different amount of turns to obtain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/mainStuff.gif?t=1743924193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You get new building foundations by dropping matter (resources) into the rift. If the resource was one of the marked ones - you will also get research points progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, the more you interact with a particular building, the more fragility it accumulates and can disintegrate if you are not careful and do not take care to reduce this fragility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/slotTransit.gif?t=1743924193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/recipeGuide.png?t=1743924193\" />The <strong>core mechanics</strong> are built around combining resources and buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put resource {2} into building {1}, it transmutes into building {3} and resource {4} is created at the moment of transformation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The recipe shown will not work instantly but with a delay of one turn {5}. The resulting building will have more fragility than the original {6}. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* - How many buildings and resources of the specified type do you currently have </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/ttl_exp.png?t=1743924193\" />As you progress through the research map, you select building variants with different recipes and capabilities. This way, each run will be different.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3188690?t=1743924193","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/7cceeb606b2e47d939985aeadfb2123728e54290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743924193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/c4f6fccf44391e9c14ffc1935e98841a6fca40e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743924193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/c4f6fccf44391e9c14ffc1935e98841a6fca40e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743924193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We combined a city-building simulator and crafting\u00a0alchemy game to get an interesting turn-based strategy. In this game, you do not just build buildings, but change those that are there into the ones you need, spending and receiving resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/meme.png?t=1743924193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/ttl_thing.png?t=1743924193\" />Each building can be obtained from several recipes and used in a number of recipes to obtain another building and/or resources, including units and other valuables. Thus, the same building can cost different amounts of different resources and require different amount of turns to obtain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/mainStuff.gif?t=1743924193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You get new building foundations by dropping matter (resources) into the rift. If the resource was one of the marked ones - you will also get research points progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, the more you interact with a particular building, the more fragility it accumulates and can disintegrate if you are not careful and do not take care to reduce this fragility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/slotTransit.gif?t=1743924193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/recipeGuide.png?t=1743924193\" />The <strong>core mechanics</strong> are built around combining resources and buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put resource {2} into building {1}, it transmutes into building {3} and resource {4} is created at the moment of transformation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The recipe shown will not work instantly but with a delay of one turn {5}. The resulting building will have more fragility than the original {6}. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* - How many buildings and resources of the specified type do you currently have </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/ttl_exp.png?t=1743924193\" />As you progress through the research map, you select building variants with different recipes and capabilities. This way, each run will be different.</p>","developers":["Max Estry"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/header.jpg?t=1743924193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257049677,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257049677/movie480.mp4?t=1740228173","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257049677/movie_max.mp4?t=1740228173"},"name":"Gameplay Base","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257049677/32622f95d7880429070fac503b7082641f5ca2ef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740228173","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257049677/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740228173","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257049677/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740228173"}}],"name":"Evoker's Gambit","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-530 / AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (4 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-530 / AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (4 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Max Estry"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/2b92253ca324debea056fde09e560aa18f59cd30/ss_2b92253ca324debea056fde09e560aa18f59cd30.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743924193","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/2b92253ca324debea056fde09e560aa18f59cd30/ss_2b92253ca324debea056fde09e560aa18f59cd30.600x338.jpg?t=1743924193"},{"id":14,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/3509eeeb20fe33501f6c85d6c6ca20da6ce969a9/ss_3509eeeb20fe33501f6c85d6c6ca20da6ce969a9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743924193","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/3509eeeb20fe33501f6c85d6c6ca20da6ce969a9/ss_3509eeeb20fe33501f6c85d6c6ca20da6ce969a9.600x338.jpg?t=1743924193"},{"id":15,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/8be3e9df24d31834f304b58b7f614dbcc412059e/ss_8be3e9df24d31834f304b58b7f614dbcc412059e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743924193","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/8be3e9df24d31834f304b58b7f614dbcc412059e/ss_8be3e9df24d31834f304b58b7f614dbcc412059e.600x338.jpg?t=1743924193"},{"id":16,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/b27642a3757a1e37d5ccc30164bf3c25ec5bf8ce/ss_b27642a3757a1e37d5ccc30164bf3c25e